 type="checkbox" class="absolute opacity-0 w-full h-full inset-0 cursor-pointer" value="undefined"></span></div><div class="flex gap-3 flex-1 min-w-0 items-center"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><p class="label-medium-w2 text-highEmphasis"></p><p class="poiV2NameWrapper"><span class="poiV2PlaceName">Vishakhapatnam Bus Stand</span></p><p></p><p class="label-base-w1 text-mediumEmphasis"><span class="poiV2SubText"><span class="poiV2SubTextText">Bus Terminal</span></span></p></div></div><div class="flex items-center"><div class="flex-shrink-0"><div class="poiV2Right"><span class="label-small-w2 poiV2Distance">2.2 km</span><button class="poiV2ChevronRightWrapper"><i class="poiV2ChevronRight"></i></button></div></div></div></div></div><div class="makeRelative"><div class="flex items-center relative gap-4 bg-white border-solid transition-colors duration-150 cursor-pointer py-5 poiV2NearbyListItem" aria-disabled="false" role="button" tabindex="0"><div class="flex-shrink-0"><span class="relative shrink-0 inline-flex items-center justify-center w-[18px] h-[18px] rounded m-[3px] hover:bg-[#F5F5F5] border-2 border-solid border-[#757575]" hierarchy="secondary" colorsStyle="[object Object]"><input type="checkbox" class="absolute opacity-0 w-full h-full inset-0 cursor-pointer" value="undefined"></span></div><div class="flex gap-3 flex-1 min-w-0 items-center"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><p class="label-medium-w2 text-highEmphasis"></p><p class="poiV2NameWrapper"><span class="poiV2PlaceName">Kotha Road Bus station</span></p><p></p><p class="label-base-w1 text-mediumEmphasis"><span class="poiV2SubText"><span class="poiV2SubTextText">Bus Terminal</span></span></p></div></div><div class="flex items-center"><div class="flex-shrink-0"><div class="poiV2Right"><span class="label-small-w2 poiV2Distance">2.6 km</span><button class="poiV2ChevronRightWrapper"><i class="poiV2ChevronRight"></i></button></div></div></div></div></div></ul></div></div></div></div><div class="loctnCont__rightV2"><div class="locMapHeaderV2"><ul class="poiTagsDtlNewV2"></ul><div class="makeFlex"><div class="showNearbyPrtV2"><span class="checkmarkOuter"><input type="checkbox" id="nearBy"><label for="nearBy" class="makeFlex hrtlCenter"><span class="lineHight17 font14 blackText">Nearby Hotels</span></label></span></div></div></div><div class="loctnCont__left--containerWrap"><button class="loctnCont__left--btn">Click to View Map<!-- --> <span class="sprite icLocationPinBlue appendLeft5"></span></button><div class="loctnCont__left--container" style="background-image:url(//imgak.mmtcdn.com/pwa_v3/pwa_hotel_assets/mapEntryHover.png?downsize=672:519&amp;crop=672:519);background-size:cover;background-repeat:no-repeat"></div></div></div></div></section></div></section><section class="tabPageSection" id="propertyRulesSection"><div class="paperCont appendTop16"><div class="" id="HouseRules"><div class="makeFlex spaceBetween hrtlCenter"><div class="dtlSecHdr  "><p class="newDtlsPgSectionHeading appendBottom5 ">Property Rules at AGARWAL RESIDENCY Recently Renovated</p><div class="makeFlex hrtlCenter font16 lineHight19 latoBold"><span>Check-in:<!-- --> <!-- -->11 AM</span>&nbsp;<span class="appendLeft20">Check-out:<!-- --> <!-- -->9:30 AM</span></div></div></div><div class="hrLine appendBottom16" style="background:#D8D8D8"></div><ul class="rules " style="column-count:2"><div class="highlightedReadRules appendBottom16"><div class="highlightedReadRules__badge" style="background:#E6FFF9"><img src="https://go-assets.ibcdn.com/u/MMT/images/1752828299662-couple.png" alt="Couple/Bachelor Rules" class="highlightedReadRules__badge__icon"><span class="label-small-w3 highlightedReadRules__badge__text">Couple/Bachelor Rules</span></div><div class="highlightedReadRules__content"><p class="label-base-w1 highlightedReadRules__content__text">Unmarried couples allowed. Local ids are allowed</p></div></div><li class="rules__item"><span class="font14 lineHight20">Primary Guest should be atleast 18 years of age.</span></li><li class="rules__item"><span class="font14 lineHight20">Groups with only male guests are also allowed at the property</span></li><li class="rules__item"><span class="font14 lineHight20">Govt. ID, Passport, Aadhaar and Driving License are accepted as ID proof(s)</span></li><li class="rules__item"><span class="font14 lineHight20">Pets are not allowed</span></li></ul><div class="makeFlex hrtlCenter appendTop16"><ul class="propRulesTags "><li class="propRulesTags__item"><span class="propRulesTags__itemText">Must Read Rules</span></li><li class="propRulesTags__item"><span class="propRulesTags__itemText">Guest Profile</span></li><li class="propRulesTags__item"><span class="propRulesTags__itemText">Guest Profile (Hourly)</span></li></ul><button class="textBtn appendLeft15" style="color:#008CFF">Read All Property Rules</button></div></div></div></section><div id="DontRemoveLLMContentBySEO_PhotosByGuestsSection"><section id="photosSection"><div class="paperCont appendTop16"><div class="dtlSecHdr  "><h3 class="newDtlsPgSectionHeading" id="Photos">AGARWAL RESIDENCY Recently Renovated Photos by Guests</h3></div><ul class="guestPts "><li class="guestPts__item"><img src="https://juggler.makemytrip.com/juggler/stream/key/platform-ugc-01KM874NCQC61XJSQQADQTMCCN/01KM874NCQC61XJSQQADQTMCCN.jpg" loading="lazy"></li><li class="guestPts__item"><img src="https://juggler.makemytrip.com/juggler/stream/key/platform-ugc-01KM874NG2T86ER2B5Z4SQ1KY5/01KM874NG2T86ER2B5Z4SQ1KY5.jpg" loading="lazy"></li><li class="guestPts__item"><img src="https://juggler.makemytrip.com/juggler/stream/key/platform-ugc-01KH5HG7MDC67827WEM6ZX9Q4N/01KH5HG7MDC67827WEM6ZX9Q4N.jpg" loading="lazy"></li><li class="guestPts__item"><img src="https://juggler.makemytrip.com/juggler/stream/key/platform-ugc-01KAG5RBTPCC45HYM5537NHG54/01KAG5RBTPCC45HYM5537NHG54.jpg" loading="lazy"></li><li class="guestPts__item"><img src="https://juggler.makemytrip.com/juggler/stream/key/platform-ugc-01KAG5RBWST5ZN84QYQV7T4C81/01KAG5RBWST5ZN84QYQV7T4C81.jpg" loading="lazy"></li><li class="guestPts__item"><img src="https://juggler.makemytrip.com/juggler/stream/key/platform-ugc-01KAG5RBZJ0PDSRW4PY0Z1SZA4/01KAG5RBZJ0PDSRW4PY0Z1SZA4.jpg" loading="lazy"></li><li class="guestPts__item"><img src="https://juggler.makemytrip.com/juggler/stream/key/platform-ugc-01KAG5RC1FBFYB9F8GNZJEKJ3B/01KAG5RC1FBFYB9F8GNZJEKJ3B.jpg" loading="lazy"></li><li class="guestPts__item"><img src="https://juggler.makemytrip.com/juggler/stream/key/platform-ugc-01K0P3XZY13N0H4CHR0RYNYJEQ/01K0P3XZY13N0H4CHR0RYNYJEQ.jpg" loading="lazy"></li><li class="guestPts__item"><img src="https://juggler.makemytrip.com/juggler/stream/key/platform-ugc-01K0P3Y008W8S01HASEQTHX0FS/01K0P3Y008W8S01HASEQTHX0FS.jpg" loading="lazy"></li><li class="guestPts__item"><div class="guestPts__itemText">+<!-- -->37<!-- --> <!-- -->Guest Photos</div><img src="https://juggler.makemytrip.com/juggler/stream/key/platform-ugc-01JZY3S8R5HMRFHQPN5T23RNZA/01JZY3S8R5HMRFHQPN5T23RNZA.jpg" loading="lazy"></li></ul></div></section></div><div id="DontRemoveLLMContentBySEO_UserRatingAndReviewsSection"><div class="paperCont appendTop16"><section class="tabPageSection" id="userReviewsSection"><div style="width:100%;position:relative" data-target-lang="eng" data-google-lang="en"><div id="google_element_translate_1254_mtqk7fba" style="display:none"></div><div id="content_wrapper_translate_1254_mtqk7fba" lang="en" translate="yes"><div class="appendTop5"><div class="urrSection__header appendBottom18"><div><h2 class="sectionTitle">User Rating &amp; Reviews</h2></div></div><ul class="rrTabs appendBottom20"><li class="rrTabs__item titText selected">everyone</li><li class="rrTabs__item titText ">group</li><li class="rrTabs__item titText ">couple</li><li class="rrTabs__item titText ">solo</li><li class="rrTabs__item titText ">business</li><li class="rrTabs__item titText ">family</li></ul><div class="urrSection"><div class="urrSection__left"><div class="ovrlRating appendBottom20"><span itemProp="worstRating" content="1"></span><div class="ovrlRating__rating blueBg" itemProp="ratingValue">3.8</div><span itemProp="bestRating" content="5"></span><div class="ovrlRating__desc"><div><span class="ovrlRating__title">Very Good</span></div><p class="ovrlRating__subTitle">395 Ratings</p></div></div><div class="ratingGrph mmt "><div role="button" tabindex="0" class="ratingGrph__row ratingGrph__row--clickable "><span class="ratingGrph__text titText">excellent</span><div class="ratingGrph__bar"><div class="ratingGrph__barProgress" style="width:27%"></div></div><span class="ratingGrph__percent">27%</span></div><div role="button" tabindex="0" class="ratingGrph__row ratingGrph__row--clickable "><span class="ratingGrph__text titText">very good</span><div class="ratingGrph__bar"><div class="ratingGrph__barProgress" style="width:32%"></div></div><span class="ratingGrph__percent">32%</span></div><div role="button" tabindex="0" class="ratingGrph__row ratingGrph__row--clickable "><span class="ratingGrph__text titText">average</span><div class="ratingGrph__bar"><div class="ratingGrph__barProgress" style="width:17%"></div></div><span class="ratingGrph__percent">17%</span></div><div role="button" tabindex="0" class="ratingGrph__row ratingGrph__row--clickable "><span class="ratingGrph__text titText">poor</span><div class="ratingGrph__bar"><div class="ratingGrph__barProgress" style="width:15%"></div></div><span class="ratingGrph__percent">15%</span></div><div role="button" tabindex="0" class="ratingGrph__row ratingGrph__row--clickable "><span class="ratingGrph__text titText">bad</span><div class="ratingGrph__bar"><div class="ratingGrph__barProgress" style="width:9%"></div></div><span class="ratingGrph__percent">9%</span></div></div><div class="hrLine appendTop20 appendBottom20" style="background:#D8D8D8"></div><div class="rcr "><p class="rcr__title">Last 10 Customer Ratings<!-- --> <span class="rcr__subtitle">(<!-- -->Latest First<!-- -->)</span></p><ul class="rcr__list"><li>4</li><li>5</li><li>3</li><li>3</li><li>5</li><li>3</li><li>5</li><li>4</li><li>5</li><li>5</li></ul></div><div class="hrLine appendTop20 appendBottom20" style="background:#D8D8D8"></div><div class="ratingCat mmt "><p class="font18 lineHight22 latoBlack appendBottom20">Rating Categories</p><ul class="ratingCat__list"><li class="ratingCat__listItem"><span class="font16 lineHight19">Location</span><span class="ratingCat__listItemRating">4.0</span></li><li class="ratingCat__listItem"><span class="font16 lineHight19">Cleanliness</span><span class="ratingCat__listItemRating">3.6</span></li><li class="ratingCat__listItem"><span class="font16 lineHight19">Room</span><span class="ratingCat__listItemRating">3.9</span></li><li class="ratingCat__listItem"><span class="font16 lineHight19">Food</span><span class="ratingCat__listItemRating">3.0</span></li><li class="ratingCat__listItem"><span class="font16 lineHight19">Hospitality</span><span class="ratingCat__listItemRating">3.9</span></li><li class="ratingCat__listItem"><span class="font16 lineHight19">Value For Money</span><span class="ratingCat__listItemRating">3.5</span></li></ul></div></div><div class="urrSection__right"><div class="trvlImp "><div class="trvlImp__hdr"><span class="trvlImp__icon appendRight10"><img src="https://promos.makemytrip.com/Hotels_product/Component_1059.png" alt="icon"><div class="trvlImp__expanded font14 latoBold whiteText">We are using generative AI to show you summarised user review</div></span><div class="flexOne"><p class="font18 lineHight22 latoBlack">Review Summary</p><p class="trvlImp__subtitle">Powered by Myra.AI</p></div></div><div class="trvlImp__body"><p></p><ul class="rules"><li class="rules__item"><span class="font14 lineHight20">Good and cooperative staff.</span></li><li class="rules__item"><span class="font14 lineHight20">Rooms are spacious and clean.</span></li><li class="rules__item"><span class="font14 lineHight20">Prime location near RK beach and city spots.</span></li><li class="rules__item"><span class="font14 lineHight20">No in-house restaurant; food from nearby eateries.</span></li></ul><span style="color:#0084ff;cursor:pointer;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold">Read more</span><p></p></div></div><div class="hrLine appendBottom20 appendTop20" style="background:#D8D8D8"></div><div><div class="fltrBy "><p class="label-large-w3 appendBottom10">Filter By:</p><ul class="fltrBy__list"><li class="sortBy__dropdownCont"><div class="sortBy__dropdown "><span>Sort : <!-- -->Most relevant</span></div></li><li class="fltrBy__listItem selected">All Reviews</li><li class="sortBy__dropdownCont"><div class="sortBy__dropdown fltrBy__listItem "><span>Room Type</span></div></li><li class="fltrBy__listItem ">Review with Images</li></ul></div></div><div class="userRvs "><div class="userRvs__item "><div class="userRvs__itemHdr"><span class="userRvs__rtng">5.0</span><div class="flexOne"><p class="font16 lineHight19 latoBlack">Excellent Stay</p><div class="userRvs__rvdtl"><span class="userRvs__rvdtlPoints titText">ajay a.</span><span class="sprite grayDot appendLeft5 appendRight5"></span><span class="userRvs__rvdtlPoints titText">family with 1 kid</span></div></div></div><div class="reviewTextContainer lineHight20 appendTop12 appendBottom12"><p class="label-base-w1 reviewText ">It is being a stay you can call Home comforts
Safety for family
Friendly staff
Iconic location
And Lot of food options near by.</p></div><span class="font14 lineHight17 latoBold blackText">Travel Month:</span> <span class="font14 lineHight17">Aug 2026</span><p class="appendTop5"><span class="font14 lineHight17 latoBold blackText">Room:</span> <span class="font14 lineHight17">Royal AC Room</span></p></div><div class="userRvs__item "><div class="userRvs__itemHdr"><span class="userRvs__rtng">4.0</span><div class="flexOne"><p class="font16 lineHight19 latoBlack">Good Stay</p><div class="userRvs__rvdtl"><span class="userRvs__rvdtlPoints titText">anurag p.</span></div></div></div><div class="reviewTextContainer lineHight20 appendTop12 appendBottom12"><p class="label-base-w1 reviewText ">Good and cooperative staff and did felt anything wrong with room. Rooms were clean and nice.</p></div><span class="font14 lineHight17 latoBold blackText">Travel Month:</span> <span class="font14 lineHight17">Jun 2026 (4-Night Stay)</span><p class="appendTop5"><span class="font14 lineHight17 latoBold blackText">Room:</span> <span class="font14 lineHight17">Cozy AC Room</span></p></div><div class="userRvs__item "><div class="userRvs__itemHdr"><span class="userRvs__rtng">4.0</span><div class="flexOne"><p class="font16 lineHight19 latoBlack">wonderful location</p><div class="userRvs__rvdtl"><span class="userRvs__rvdtlPoints titText">ravikant k.</span><span class="sprite grayDot appendLeft5 appendRight5"></span><span class="userRvs__rvdtlPoints titText">family</span></div></div></div><div class="reviewTextContainer lineHight20 appendTop12 appendBottom12"><p class="label-base-w1 reviewText ">everything was good staff and cleanness value for money , All famous location like RK beach , submarine museum , kailasha giri park and rishikonda is nearby</p></div><span class="font14 lineHight17 latoBold blackText">Travel Month:</span> <span class="font14 lineHight17">May 2026 (4-Night Stay)</span><p class="appendTop5"><span class="font14 lineHight17 latoBold blackText">Room:</span> <span class="font14 lineHight17">Family Room- 2 King size Beds</span></p></div><div class="userRvs__item "><div class="userRvs__itemHdr"><span class="userRvs__rtng">3.0</span><div class="flexOne"><p class="font16 lineHight19 latoBlack">Average Stay</p><div class="userRvs__rvdtl"><span class="userRvs__rvdtlPoints titText">rachala b.</span><span class="sprite grayDot appendLeft5 appendRight5"></span><span class="userRvs__rvdtlPoints titText">family with 1 kid</span></div></div></div><div class="reviewTextContainer lineHight20 appendTop12 appendBottom12"><p class="label-base-w1 reviewText ">Room looks good, but paint and things in room are slightly dirty. Staff is good and polite. Washroom and room are slightly dirty. Bucket in washroom is dirty. Ambience is average. It satisfies 50-60% of hotel price. But 1680 Rs is a bit expensive for that room.</p></div><span class="font14 lineHight17 latoBold blackText">Travel Month:</span> <span class="font14 lineHight17">May 2026</span><p class="appendTop5"><span class="font14 lineHight17 latoBold blackText">Room:</span> <span class="font14 lineHight17">Cozy AC Room</span></p></div><div class="userRvs__item "><div class="userRvs__itemHdr"><span class="userRvs__rtng">5.0</span><div class="flexOne"><p class="font16 lineHight19 latoBlack">Room stay review for 17th to 21st May 2026</p><div class="userRvs__rvdtl"><span class="userRvs__rvdtlPoints titText">jayanth p.</span><span class="sprite grayDot appendLeft5 appendRight5"></span><span class="userRvs__rvdtlPoints titText">family</span></div></div></div><div class="reviewTextContainer lineHight20 appendTop12 appendBottom12"><p class="label-base-w1 reviewText ">Overall good stay, spacious rooms, comfortable bed, good location for city all round connectivity. Also available cupboards in rooms for keeping things.</p></div><span class="font14 lineHight17 latoBold blackText">Travel Month:</span> <span class="font14 lineHight17">May 2026 (4-Night Stay)</span><p class="appendTop5"><span class="font14 lineHight17 latoBold blackText">Room:</span> <span class="font14 lineHight17">Cozy AC Room</span></p></div><div class="userRvs__item "><div class="userRvs__itemHdr"><span class="userRvs__rtng">3.0</span><div class="flexOne"><p class="font16 lineHight19 latoBlack">Average Stay</p><div class="userRvs__rvdtl"><span class="userRvs__rvdtlPoints titText">santhosh k.</span></div></div></div><div class="reviewTextContainer lineHight20 appendTop12 appendBottom12"><p class="label-base-w1 reviewText ">At check-in time they are providing water bottle is that ok but every time we can't buy water bottles by paying money so drinking water is the basic need so it should be provided complementary even they can provide RO water for drinking purpose</p></div><span class="font14 lineHight17 latoBold blackText">Travel Month:</span> <span class="font14 lineHight17">Apr 2026</span><p class="appendTop5"><span class="font14 lineHight17 latoBold blackText">Room:</span> <span class="font14 lineHight17">Cozy AC Room</span></p></div><div class="userRvs__item "><div class="userRvs__itemHdr"><span class="userRvs__rtng">5.0</span><div class="flexOne"><p class="font16 lineHight19 latoBlack">Excellent Stay</p><div class="userRvs__rvdtl"><span class="userRvs__rvdtlPoints titText">g s.</span><span class="sprite grayDot appendLeft5 appendRight5"></span><span class="userRvs__rvdtlPoints titText">couple</span></div></div></div><div class="reviewTextContainer lineHight20 appendTop12 appendBottom12"><p class="label-base-w1 reviewText ">Very good hotel especially if you’re visiting with a family and even if unmarried couples. The staff are helpful and premises are clean as well. You’ll get good dining options, SBI and bike rentals in the nearby vicinity. Overall experience was very good and definitely recommended.</p></div><span class="font14 lineHight17 latoBold blackText">Travel Month:</span> <span class="font14 lineHight17">Mar 2026 (3-Night Stay)</span><p class="appendTop5"><span class="font14 lineHight17 latoBold blackText">Room:</span> <span class="font14 lineHight17">Cozy AC Room</span></p><ul class="usrReviewPhotos appendTop10"><li><img loading="lazy" src="https://juggler.makemytrip.com/juggler/stream/key/platform-ugc-01KM874NCQC61XJSQQADQTMCCN/01KM874NCQC61XJSQQADQTMCCN.jpg" alt="user photos"></li><li><img loading="lazy" src="https://juggler.makemytrip.com/juggler/stream/key/platform-ugc-01KM874NG2T86ER2B5Z4SQ1KY5/01KM874NG2T86ER2B5Z4SQ1KY5.jpg" alt="user photos"></li><li><img loading="lazy" src="https://juggler.makemytrip.com/juggler/stream/key/platform-ugc-01KM874NKCADSX6Q8Z8VHNZER7/01KM874NKCADSX6Q8Z8VHNZER7.jpg" alt="user photos"></li></ul></div><div class="userRvs__item "><div class="userRvs__itemHdr"><span class="userRvs__rtng">4.0</span><div class="flexOne"><p class="font16 lineHight19 latoBlack">good</p><div class="userRvs__rvdtl"><span class="userRvs__rvdtlPoints titText">durgesh.</span><span class="sprite grayDot appendLeft5 appendRight5"></span><span class="userRvs__rvdtlPoints titText">family with 1 kid</span></div></div></div><div class="reviewTextContainer lineHight20 appendTop12 appendBottom12"><p class="label-base-w1 reviewText ">Hotel is very good for the price. Room is very clean, all facilities available, all accessories are working.</p></div><span class="font14 lineHight17 latoBold blackText">Travel Month:</span> <span class="font14 lineHight17">Feb 2026</span><p class="appendTop5"><span class="font14 lineHight17 latoBold blackText">Room:</span> <span class="font14 lineHight17">Cozy AC Room</span></p><div class="replyMsg appendTop20"><span class="sprite replyIcon appendRight15 noShrink"></span><div class="replyMsg__dtl"><p><span class="font16 lineHight19 latoBlack">AGARWAL RESIDENCY Recently Renovated</span> <span class="font14">has replied on Sat Feb 21 11:16:13 IST 2026</span></p><p class="font14 lineHight20 appendTop5">Thank you sir, visit again
</p></div></div></div><div class="userRvs__item "><div class="userRvs__itemHdr"><span class="userRvs__rtng">4.0</span><div class="flexOne"><p class="font16 lineHight19 latoBlack">Good Stay</p><div class="userRvs__rvdtl"><span class="userRvs__rvdtlPoints titText">krishna m.</span><span class="sprite grayDot appendLeft5 appendRight5"></span><span class="userRvs__rvdtlPoints titText">family with 2 kids</span></div></div></div><div class="reviewTextContainer lineHight20 appendTop12 appendBottom12"><p class="label-base-w1 reviewText ">Its just normal hotel, dont expect much facilities. Room is good. Hotel is in the good location of city. You will find outside all the facilities. Best budget hotel for families.</p></div><span class="font14 lineHight17 latoBold blackText">Travel Month:</span> <span class="font14 lineHight17">Feb 2026 (3-Night Stay)</span><p class="appendTop5"><span class="font14 lineHight17 latoBold blackText">Room:</span> <span class="font14 lineHight17">Cozy AC Room</span></p><ul class="usrReviewPhotos appendTop10"><li><img loading="lazy" src="https://juggler.makemytrip.com/juggler/stream/key/platform-ugc-01KH5HG7CCNH9ER8XQFGQ3JZHB/01KH5HG7CCNH9ER8XQFGQ3JZHB.jpg" alt="user photos"></li><li><img loading="lazy" src="https://juggler.makemytrip.com/juggler/stream/key/platform-ugc-01KH5HG7MDC67827WEM6ZX9Q4N/01KH5HG7MDC67827WEM6ZX9Q4N.jpg" alt="user photos"></li></ul><div class="replyMsg appendTop20"><span class="sprite replyIcon appendRight15 noShrink"></span><div class="replyMsg__dtl"><p><span class="font16 lineHight19 latoBlack">AGARWAL RESIDENCY Recently Renovated</span> <span class="font14">has replied on Sat Feb 21 11:19:05 IST 2026</span></p><p class="font14 lineHight20 appendTop5">Thank you sir,
