</div>    <div class="mainContainer" id="hd_review_block">
        <section class="blankBox appendTop20">
            <h2 class="headingReview appendBottom16">Planning to Book AGARWAL RESIDENCY Recently Renovated ? Get inspired by Popular Reviews</h2>
            <div class="rvsList">
                    <div class="rvsListItem">
                        <div class="rvsListItem__hdr">
                            <div class="rvsListItem__hdrLft">
                                <p class="rvsListItem__title">Excellent Stay</p>
                                <p class="rvsListItem__subtitle">G Sagar</p>
                            </div>
                            <span class="rvsListItem__count">5</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="rvsListItem__body">
                            <p>Very good AGARWAL RESIDENCY Recently Renovated especially if you’re visiting with a family and even if unmarried couples. The staff are helpful and premises are clean as well. You’ll get good dining options, SBI and bike rentals in the nearby vicinity. Overall experience was very good and definitely recommended.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="rvsListItem">
                        <div class="rvsListItem__hdr">
                            <div class="rvsListItem__hdrLft">
                                <p class="rvsListItem__title">good no frills budget hotel</p>
                                <p class="rvsListItem__subtitle">Dibasri Bhowmick</p>
                            </div>
                            <span class="rvsListItem__count">5</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="rvsListItem__body">
                            <p>value for money . The staff was responsive. They don't have inhouse restaurant but there were many eateries in and around the AGARWAL RESIDENCY Recently Renovated. The area is a bit run down compared to other parts of Visakhapatnam but it is close to the railway station.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="rvsListItem">
                        <div class="rvsListItem__hdr">
                            <div class="rvsListItem__hdrLft">
                                <p class="rvsListItem__title">Good Stay</p>
                                <p class="rvsListItem__subtitle">Krishna Mohan</p>
                            </div>
                            <span class="rvsListItem__count">4</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="rvsListItem__body">
                            <p>Its just normal AGARWAL RESIDENCY Recently Renovated, dont expect much facilities. Room is good. Hotel is in the good location of city. You will find outside all the facilities. Best budget AGARWAL RESIDENCY Recently Renovated for families.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="rvsListItem">
                        <div class="rvsListItem__hdr">
                            <div class="rvsListItem__hdrLft">
                                <p class="rvsListItem__title">Good Stay</p>
                                <p class="rvsListItem__subtitle">Sai Charan</p>
                            </div>
                            <span class="rvsListItem__count">4</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="rvsListItem__body">
                            <p>the location of the AGARWAL RESIDENCY Recently Renovated is in a prime location It is very accessible AGARWAL RESIDENCY Recently Renovated newly renovated So it is very clean and neat  the services also good</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="rvsListItem">
                        <div class="rvsListItem__hdr">
                            <div class="rvsListItem__hdrLft">
                                <p class="rvsListItem__title">Good Stay</p>
                                <p class="rvsListItem__subtitle">Subhakant Sahoo</p>
                            </div>
                            <span class="rvsListItem__count">4</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="rvsListItem__body">
                            <p>excellent stay experience. service was a bit dull but other than that rooms were very clean and tidy. If touring around all day is what you want, then this place is wonderful for a good nights sleep</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="rvsListItem">
                        <div class="rvsListItem__hdr">
                            <div class="rvsListItem__hdrLft">
                                <p class="rvsListItem__title">Excellent Stay</p>
                                <p class="rvsListItem__subtitle">Vanshika Bhati</p>
                            </div>
                            <span class="rvsListItem__count">5</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="rvsListItem__body">
                            <p>The experience was excellent the staff there was so helping and kind even having language barrier there were so helpful 
Location was good everything was nearby only overall the stay was good</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="rvsListItem">
                        <div class="rvsListItem__hdr">
                            <div class="rvsListItem__hdrLft">
                                <p class="rvsListItem__title">good</p>
                                <p class="rvsListItem__subtitle">Durgesh  kumar</p>
                            </div>
                            <span class="rvsListItem__count">4</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="rvsListItem__body">
                            <p>Hotel is very good for the price. Room is very clean, all facilities available, all accessories are working.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="rvsListItem">
                        <div class="rvsListItem__hdr">
