1KV0Q4XZHV4Y2EV0XN8EXM4Q4","travelType":"ALL","crawledData":false,"isUpvoted":false},{"publishDate":"2026-06-01 17:02:19","logo":"","travellerName":"ravikant kumar","title":"wonderful location","rating":4.0,"reviewText":"everything was good staff and cleanness value for money , All famous location like RK beach , submarine museum , kailasha giri park and rishikonda is nearby","id":"01KT1F7QJ0PFFBE3EW0XEJZJKX","travelType":"FAMILY","crawledData":false,"isUpvoted":false},{"publishDate":"2026-05-30 21:17:54","logo":"","travellerName":"RACHALA BHUVAN SAI","title":"Average Stay","rating":3.0,"reviewText":"Room looks good, but paint and things in room are slightly dirty. Staff is good and polite. Washroom and room are slightly dirty. Bucket in washroom is dirty. Ambience is average. It satisfies 50-60% of hotel price. But 1680 Rs is a bit expensive for that room.","id":"01KSWS3NC8MED7THD9R144KP1E","travelType":"FAMILY","crawledData":false,"isUpvoted":false},{"publishDate":"2026-05-21 16:00:17","logo":"","travellerName":"Jayanth Pudducheri","title":"Room stay review for 17th to 21st May 2026","rating":5.0,"reviewText":"Overall good stay, spacious rooms, comfortable bed, good location for city all round connectivity. Also available cupboards in rooms for keeping things.","id":"01KS51BVXH50RZYYZZEWVVDC3Y","travelType":"FAMILY","crawledData":false,"isUpvoted":false},{"publishDate":"2026-04-10 21:05:24","logo":"","travellerName":"Santhosh Kumar","title":"Average Stay","rating":3.0,"reviewText":"At check-in time they are providing water bottle is that ok but every time we can\u0027t buy water bottles by paying money so drinking water is the basic need so it should be provided complementary even they can provide RO water for drinking purpose","id":"01KNW0H8G65WWHYJQ2RPDE2DGS","travelType":"ALL","crawledData":false,"isUpvoted":false},{"publishDate":"2026-03-21 18:15:54","logo":"","travellerName":"G Sagar","title":"Excellent Stay","rating":5.0,"reviewText":"Very good hotel especially if you’re visiting with a family and even if unmarried couples. The staff are helpful and premises are clean as well. You’ll get good dining options, SBI and bike rentals in the nearby vicinity. Overall experience was very good and definitely recommended.","id":"01KM86WC89C3D7JWR953H87PN9","travelType":"COUPLE","crawledData":false,"isUpvoted":false},{"publishDate":"2026-02-18 10:02:28","logo":"","travellerName":"Durgesh  kumar","title":"good","rating":4.0,"reviewText":"Hotel is very good for the price. Room is very clean, all facilities available, all accessories are working.","id":"01KHQGAK7033SYMSZ31SZVDH63","travelType":"GROUP","crawledData":false,"isUpvoted":false},{"publishDate":"2026-02-11 10:27:54","logo":"","travellerName":"Krishna Mohan","title":"Good Stay","rating":4.0,"reviewText":"Its just normal hotel, dont expect much facilities. Room is good. Hotel is in the good location of city. You will find outside all the facilities. Best budget hotel for families.","id":"01KH5H019QP7PKH5JY1V6ZSVS8","travelType":"FAMILY","crawledData":false,"isUpvoted":false},{"publishDate":"2026-02-01 10:04:56","logo":"","travellerName":"Chiranjeevi Tati","title":"Good Stay","rating":4.0,"reviewText":"Receiving and service is good.\nAmenities also clean and proper","id":"01KGBQQ0YYRR9H6DZNRQKMA738","travelType":"SOLO","crawledData":false,"isUpvoted":false}],"travelTypes":["EVERYONE","GROUP","COUPLE","SOLO","BUSINESS","FAMILY"],"showUpvote":true,"recentRatings":[4.0,5.0,3.0,3.0,5.0,3.0,5.0,4.0,5.0,5.0],"hotelRatingSummary":[{"concept":"Location","displayText":"Location","reviewCount":75.0,"value":4.0,"show":true,"heroTag":false},{"concept":"Cleanliness","displayText":"Cleanliness","reviewCount":142.0,"value":3.6,"show":true,"heroTag":false},{"concept":"Room","displayText":"Room","reviewCount":61.0,"value":3.9,"show":true,"heroTag":false},{"concept":"Food","displayText":"Food","reviewCount":26.0,"value":3.0,"show":true,"heroTag":false},{"concept":"Hospitality","displayText":"H