03c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e by guests"}],"summary":{"iconUrl":"https://promos.makemytrip.com/Hotels_product/Component_1059.png","text":"Guests praised the property’s prime location, noting its proximity to railway stations, markets, and beaches, making it very accessible for various amenities. Many enjoyed the convenience of nearby eateries and shopping areas. Some mentioned minor concerns about being in a slightly run-down area, but overall, the location received high marks for its central position and accessibility."}},"trackingMap":{"m_c1":"eligible_loc_wgs"}},"weaverResponse":{"success":true,"data":{"rendering_slot":"details_page","summary_view":{"template":"summary_view_template_1","data":{"title":"About AGARWAL RESIDENCY Recently Renovated","headline":"\u003cb\u003eLocated in the heart of the Visakhapatnam, Hotel Saaket Residency offers you a home-like stay through its comfortable amenities and blissful surroundings.\u003c/b\u003e","highlights":["Stay connected to your loved ones with a steady WiFi connection offered on-site.","Enjoy easy connectivity as the hotel is just 1.8 km from Vishakapatnam Train Station.","Relish delicious Indian, Chinese and Continental delicacies served on-site."],"layers":[{"id":"1595858708660","title":{"text":"Property Highlights","color":"#040404"},"main_block":{"bgcolor":"#EDF6FF","border_color":"#C8E6FE"},"icon":{"url":"https://promos.makemytrip.com/hoteldescription/Property.png"}},{"id":"1595858717150","title":{"text":"Activities \u0026 Nearby Attractions","color":"#040404"},"main_block":{"bgcolor":"#EDF6FF","border_color":"#C8E6FE"},"icon":{"url":"https://promos.makemytrip.com/hoteldescription/Activities.png"}},{"id":"1595858719770","title":{"text":"How to Reach the Property","color":"#040404"},"main_block":{"bgcolor":"#EDF6FF","border_color":"#C8E6FE"},"icon":{"url":"https://promos.makemytrip.com/hoteldescription/Reach.png"}}]}},"detail_view":{"template":"detail_view_template_1","data":{"title":"AGARWAL RESIDENCY Recently Renovated ","img":"https://r1imghtlak.mmtcdn.com/d1d79e3c-e989-4ad5-87d1-0fd79fcc18f3.jpeg","headline":"\u003cb\u003eLocated in the heart of the Visakhapatnam, Hotel Saaket Residency offers you a home-like stay through its comfortable amenities and blissful surroundings.\u003c/b\u003e","layers":{"1595858708660":{"title":"Property Highlights","layout":"bullet","data":[[{"type":"text","data":"The hotel is fully air-conditioned and has an uninterrupted Wi-fi connection throughout."}],[{"type":"text","data":"With a reception, the guests can have direct correspondence at the property regarding their needs and requirements."}],[{"type":"text","data":"The retreat also has a bellboy service at the beck and call of the guests."}],[{"type":"text","data":"Ensuring the well-being and security of the guests, the retreat is under CCTV surveillance and has security and fire extinguishers."}],[{"type":"text","data":"A seating area is provided for the convenience of the waiting guests."},{"type":"img","data":"https://r2imghtlak.mmtcdn.com/r2-mmt-htl-image/htl-imgs/201909261247524085-fe1a1758e99d11e98cff0242ac110002.jpg"}],[{"type":"text","data":"The residence sets up 3 designs of rooms. "}],[{"type":"text","data":"Royal Darbar occupies an area of 266 sq ft and offers king-size beds. "}],[{"type":"text","data":"Royal and Luxury rooms occupy an area of 252 sq ft \u0026amp; 216 sq ft respectively and offer a king-size or 2 twin beds."}],[{"type":"text","data":"Each room can house 3 guests and extends pillows, cushions, blankets, couch, sofa, clothes rack with hangers, cupboards with lock, ceiling fan, air conditioning centre table, dining, seating \u0026amp; living areas, Wi-Fi, telephone, TV, study room, newspapers, electrical sockets, dustbins, ironing board, electric kettle, laundry, dry cleaning services, 24-hour room service and daily housekeeping. "}],[{"type":"text","data":"The attached bathrooms come hot/cold water, mirror, towels and shower. "},{"type":"img","data":"https://r2imghtlak.mmtcdn.com/r2-mmt-htl-image/htl-imgs/201909261247524085-40a709de1eee11ea97e60242ac110005.jpg"}]],"imageList":["https://r2imghtlak.mmtcdn.com/r2-mmt-htl-image/htl-imgs/201909261247524085-fe1a1758e99d11e98cff0242ac110002.jpg","https://r2imghtlak.mmtcdn.com/r2-mmt-htl-image/htl-imgs/201909261247524085-40a709de1eee11ea97e60242ac110005.jpg"]},"1595858717150":{"title":"Activities \u0026 Nearby Attractions","layout":"bullet","data":[[{"type":"text","data":"Dr Y S Rajasekhara Reddy Central Park, 2.1 km apart can be visited for a fun frolic picnic day out. "}],[{"type":"text","data":"Matsya Darshini, 2.9 km away displays a diverse variety of marine plants and creatures."}],[{"type":"text","data":"Visakha Museum, 4.8 km expounds an array of artefacts insinuating the development of the city and the naval history."}]],"imageList":[]},"1595858719770":{"title":"How to Reach the Property","layout":"paragraph","data":[[{"type":"text","data":"The hotel is 1.8 km from Vishakapatnam train station, 4.1 km from Maddilapalem bus depot and 10.5 km from Visakhapatnam International Airport."}]],"imageList":[]}},"layers_rank":["1595858708660","1595858717150","1595858719770"]}},"flags":[]}},"completedRequests":["ORCH_c509a905-66f7-4739-8521-81e9247f5e71:ROOM_INFO","ORCH_c509a905-66f7-4739-8521-81e9247f5e71:AGGREGATED_MEDIA","ORCH_c509a905-66f7-4739-8521-81e9247f5e71:AGENT_SUGGESTIONS","ORCH_c509a905-66f7-4739-8521-81e9247f5e71:TRAVELLER_REVIEW_SUMMARY","ORCH_c509a905-66f7-4739-8521-81e9247f5e71:PERSONALIZED_CARDS","ORCH_c509a905-66f7-4739-8521-81e9247f5e71:AGGREGATED_PLACES","ORCH_c509a905-66f7-4739-8521-81e9247f5e71:AGGREGATED_HOTEL_INFO","ORCH_c509a905-66f7-4739-8521-81e9247f5e71:COMPARATOR_HOTEL_DETAIL","ORCH_c509a905-66f7-4739-8521-81e9247f5e71:WEAVER","ORCH_c509a905-66f7-4739-8521-81e9247f5e71:HOST_SUMMARY","PLACES","ORCH_c509a905-66f7-4739-8521-81e9247f5e71:CHAT_BOT_PERSUASION"],"uuids":[],"expVariantKeys":"c4h,cyg,d8k,df2,doo,duj,e5f,edp,ef4,efv,epq","expVariantKeysList":["c4h,c